ok 2 - a BEFORE INSERT version-lock guard exists on cms_publication_versions
ok 3 - the guard function is not executable by browser roles
ok 4 - the guard locks the target content-type version row FOR SHARE (not a plain read)
ok 5 - both switch paths lock the source version row FOR UPDATE, the lock mode that conflicts with FOR SHARE [P2-S09-AC-097]
